11970},{"id":"72157710465984236","position":163}],"bytes":1952122,"camera_position":12061,"comments":[{"author":"50167308@N06","date":"2019-10-07 13:08:16","text":"Oh the right-wing populist party - lot of increment in the last elections, particular in eastern Germany. Hope their time will be over soon - as well as with your president (sorry to become too political) ..."},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2019-10-09 22:41:40","text":"[https://www.flickr.com/photos/italobikes-v2jo] It's alright.  I found all of the posters interesting.  In the past, I've posted a lot of the Canadian political posters from Quebec and it is the same dichotomy. Phil (Brompton guy) explained a bit and it seems like it is part of an old human pattern, \"things are tough, so let's worry about ourselves and make things much worse for all of us\".  And yes I agree, I hope their time will be over soon. \n\nIt's funny about processing all of these pics so slowly.  On the one hand, I feel bad that I am so far behind and that I can see problems with my camera that existed months ago, but also it is fun to relive this trip after having time to think about it.  It was wonderful."}],"description":"","detail":"photos/0188.json","filename":"48839958163_ab61e30581_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/48839958163/","height":2580,"id":"48839958163","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/48839958163/48839958163_ab61e30581_o.jpg","sha256":"399de92b4c27d22d6a154dd69903b28eddafa3ecc869dc3e00e2e94fd48e6e9e","tags":[],"taken":"2019-04-26 03:57:44","title":"IMG_2514","uploaded":"2019-10-03 21:23:21","width":2733},"48839958473":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":11969},{"id":"72157710465984236","position":162}],"bytes":3268230,"camera_position":12060,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0188.json","filename":"48839958473_930380d059_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/48839958473/","height":1513,"id":